{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"124a638ca50cb62eea1e3271f4efa05afb09fddd04c8e652be9d82c666eb95e1","digest":{"component_or_area":"README.md and documentation","key_entities":["README.md","docs/cli-reference.md","docs/mcp-reference.md","## CLI section","## Why rebar","## How it works","## Install","## Quickstart"],"problem_keywords":["documentation deduplication","README maintenance","volatile catalogs","generated references","command listing"],"propositions":["README.md contains duplicated command/tool/config catalogs that are now covered by generated CLI and MCP reference documents and should be replaced with links to reduce maintenance burden.","The CLI command catalog (approximately 28 lines of 'rebar <cmd>' listings under ## CLI) must be removed from README and replaced with a link to docs/cli-reference.md.","Narrative content in ## CLI section describing help resolution, output schemas, attestation, hierarchy promotion, auto-commit/push, and read-freshness policy must be preserved as part of the front-door documentation.","README.md must retain all front-door narrative sections: ## Why rebar, ## How it works, ## Install, and ## Quickstart with no dead relative links to generated reference files.","This work is sequenced after CLI/MCP reference generators land so the README points to real generated pages rather than removing content with no replacement."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785823595487159026,"uuid":"890c618f-6d8d-460d-85dd-3d078769d736"}